<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p>AZ Alkmaar 2 (Mutsaers 57th, Bociek 72nd) Graafschap Doetinchem</p>
<p>3 (Fuchs 6th, Breetveld 27th, 61st). Halftime 0-2. Attendance</p>
<p>7,704.</p>
<p>Willem II Tilburg 2 (De Gier 52nd, Van Hintum 70th penalty)</p>
<p>Heerenveen 2 (Dahl Tomasson 44th, Nygaard 69th). Halftime 0-1.</p>
<p>Attendance 7,250.</p>
<p>Played on Friday:</p>
<p>NEC Nijmegen 2 (Sumiala 45th, Van Eijkeren 68th) Utrecht 2</p>
<p>(Mols 49th, Witschge 85th). Halftime 1-0. Attendance 4,119.</p>
